{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "windsurf-gms-collection-2024",
    "name": "GMS API Testing Suite (tenant-isolation scenarios are assertions, not claims)",
    "description": "🎯 Comprehensive API testing for WindsurfGMS School Management System\n\n**Testing Workflow:**\n1. Authentication → Get JWT Token\n2. School Management → CRUD Operations (with multi-tenant security)\n3. User & Employee Management\n4. Academic Management (Students, Classes, Subjects)\n5. Assessment (Exams, Results)\n6. Financial (Fees, Payments)\n7. Communication (Announcements)\n\n**Environment Variables:**\n- base_url: http://localhost:8080\n- jwt_token: (auto-set after login)\n- school_id: (auto-set)\n- user_id, employee_id, student_id, etc.\n\n**Authentication:** JWT Token-based\n**Multi-Tenant Security:** intended as school-bounded isolation. NOT yet verified: inherited CRUD endpoints are tenant-unchecked (audit findings TEN-01..TEN-07).\n\n**Security Notes (as of 2026-11-01):**\n- Tenant isolation is the design goal, but the following cross-tenant requests are EXPECTED TO FAIL CLOSED only after the security remediation lands: GET/DELETE /{id} on student, school, user, employee, parent, classroom, subject\n- Until then, a `200`/`204` on another tenant's resource is a confirmed defect, not a pass\n- Reference: docs/audit/SECURITY_AUDIT.md attack paths AP-3 / AP-4\n\n**Credentials:** this collection contains no literal passwords. Set `superadmin_username`, `superadmin_password`, `admin_email` and `new_admin_password` in your Postman environment.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔐 1. Authentication",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/actuator/health"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login - Username",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const resp = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.environment.set('jwt_token', resp.accessToken);",
                  "    // Extract schoolId from JWT token if needed",
                  "    if (resp.user?.schoolId) pm.environment.set('school_id', resp.user.schoolId);",
                  "    if (resp.user?.id) pm.environment.set('user_id', resp.user.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"username\": \"{{superadmin_username}}\", \"password\": \"{{superadmin_password}}\"}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Current User Profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/users/me"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "🏫 2. School Management",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List My Schools",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/schools"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get School by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/schools/{{school_id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Try Accessing Another School (Should Fail)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/schools/1"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create New School",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const resp = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (resp.id) pm.environment.set('new_school_id', resp.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"schoolName\": \"Test Academy {{$timestamp}}\",\n    \"schoolCode\": \"TEST{{$randomInt}}\",\n    \"address\": \"123 Education Street, Learning City\",\n    \"phone\": \"1234567890\",\n    \"email\": \"admin{{$randomInt}}@testacademy.edu\",\n    \"principalName\": \"Dr. Principal Smith\",\n    \"establishedYear\": 2020,\n    \"boardAffiliation\": \"CBSE\",\n    \"adminFullName\": \"Test Admin {{$timestamp}}\",\n    \"adminEmail\": \"{{admin_email}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/schools/create"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update School",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"schoolName\": \"Updated Test Academy\",\n    \"schoolCode\": \"UPDATED\",\n    \"address\": \"456 Updated Street, New City\",\n    \"phone\": \"0987654321\",\n    \"email\": \"updated@testacademy.edu\",\n    \"principalName\": \"Dr. Updated Principal\",\n    \"establishedYear\": 2021,\n    \"boardAffiliation\": \"ICSE\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/schools/{{school_id}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "👥 3. User Management",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List All Users",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/users"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get User by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/users/{{user_id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Admin User",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const resp = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (resp.id) pm.environment.set('admin_user_id', resp.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"username\": \"testadmin{{$randomInt}}\",\n    \"email\": \"testadmin{{$randomInt}}@school.edu\",\n    \"fullName\": \"Test Admin User\",\n    \"password\": \"{{new_admin_password}}\",\n    \"roles\": [\"ADMIN\"]\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/users"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update User",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"fullName\": \"Updated Test User\",\n    \"email\": \"updated{{$randomInt}}@school.edu\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/users/{{user_id}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "👨‍💼 4. Employee Management",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Employees",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/employees"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Employee",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const resp = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (resp.id) pm.environment.set('employee_id', resp.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"firstName\": \"John\",\n    \"lastName\": \"Teacher\",\n    \"email\": \"john.teacher{{$randomInt}}@school.edu\",\n    \"phoneNumber\": \"9876543210\",\n    \"department\": \"ACADEMIC\",\n    \"designation\": \"TEACHER\",\n    \"isTeaching\": true,\n    \"qualification\": \"M.Ed, B.Sc Mathematics\",\n    \"experienceYears\": 5,\n    \"salary\": 50000.00\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/employees"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Employee by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/employees/{{employee_id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Employee",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"firstName\": \"John Updated\",\n    \"lastName\": \"Teacher\",\n    \"email\": \"john.updated{{$randomInt}}@school.edu\",\n    \"phoneNumber\": \"9876543211\",\n    \"department\": \"ACADEMIC\",\n    \"designation\": \"SENIOR_TEACHER\",\n    \"isTeaching\": true,\n    \"qualification\": \"M.Ed, B.Sc Mathematics, Advanced Teaching Cert\",\n    \"experienceYears\": 6,\n    \"salary\": 55000.00\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/employees/{{employee_id}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "superadmin_username",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "APP_SUPERADMIN_USERNAME"
    },
    {
      "key": "superadmin_password",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "APP_SUPERADMIN_PASSWORD - never commit"
    },
    {
      "key": "admin_email",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Email used when provisioning a new tenant admin"
    },
    {
      "key": "new_admin_password",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Password for test-created admin users"
    }
  ]
}
